<title>USA: San Francisco, Calif., $11.690 mln won by Wheat.</title>
<headline>San Francisco, Calif., $11.690 mln won by Wheat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First said it won $11.690 million of San Francisco City &amp; Cty Redevelopment Financing Authority, Calif., tax allocation taxable revenue bonds, 1996, Series C, with a true interest cost of 7.08 percent.</p>
</text>
